# pgRDF GeoSPARQL fixture. Original work, authored for pgRDF from the
# GeoSPARQL 1.1 rule definitions catalogued in ../../RULES.md. No
# third-party fixture text is reproduced.
#
# Rule:   S01-serialization-cardinality
# Expect: INVALID
# Why:    literal is GeoJSON text but typed geo:wktLiteral

@prefix geo:  <http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/pgrdf/> .

ex:g-lighthouse
    geo:asWKT "{ \"type\": \"Point\", \"coordinates\": [10.5, 52.3] }"^^geo:wktLiteral ;
.
